# Subagents

Use `Task` with `subagent_type: "poteto-agent"` only. Do not use `explore`, `generalPurpose`, or `plan`.

Model is the grok 4.5/4.6 family. Resume an existing poteto-agent. Do not spawn a sibling for the same thread. Ensure that the correct model is picked for the difficulty of the task.

```
# BAD
Task(subagent_type="explore", model="fast")

# GOOD
Task(subagent_type="poteto-agent", model="cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh", prompt="...")
```

Pass file pointers in the prompt. Do not dump whole files. The parent reviews the diff.
